      "description": "Department: College of Aviation, Science, and Nursing - HSU\nAssistant Professor 9 Mo | Working Title | Assistant Professor 9 Mo | Position # | F00138 | Department | College of Aviation, Science, and Nursing - HSU\nNew Search Login Page Job Details Please note: all position postings close at 12:00 A.M. CST on the position closing date Assistant Professor 9 Mo Working Title Assistant Professor 9 Mo Position # F00138 Department College of Aviation, Science, and Nursing - HSU Apply Now Employment Status: Full time (29-40 Hrs) Type of Employment: Faculty # of openings: 1 Location: Henderson State University Proposed Salary Range: $48,000-$50,000.00 Closing: 11/3/26 Please note: All postings close at 12 A.M. CST on the closing date.  This employer participates in E-Verify. Position Summary: The College of Aviation, Science, and Nursing at Henderson State University invites applicants for a position in Biology at the rank of assistant professor. Candidates with a focus in biological sciences with an emphasis on microbiology, introductory biology, and upper-level biological laboratory skills. Duties & Responsibilities: Teaching courses within the discipline at all undergraduate levels, Participating in campus committees, Advising students, Contributing to the development and growth of programs, Participating in efforts to improve student success, Additional duties according to experience and expertise. Knowledge/Skills/Abilities: General Days/Hours: Hours vary. Additional hours as requested and/or needed. Other: Please note: all position postings close at 12:00 A.M. CST on the position closing date. Minimum Qualifications: Earned master's degree in Biology or a closely related field required. Minimum of five (5) years of full-time teaching experience in higher education. Ph.D. in Biology or a closely related field preferred; ABD candidates will also be considered. Applicants must be legally authorized to work in the United States by the proposed start date. E-Verify Participation Notice: https://www.e-verify.gov/sites/default/files/everify/posters/EVerifyParticipationPoster.pdf E-Verify Right to Work: https://www.e-verify.gov/sites/default/files/everify/posters/IER_RightToWorkPoster%20Eng_Es.pdf Back Share Apply Now"
